div.p:
On the 20th November last there was a fight on board the Merida between men under the influence of liquor, and in consequence
                    the clandestine sale of ardent spirits by Señor Allen was denounced to the
                    governor of police. In virtue thereof, the establishment (hulk) was searched;
                    the act was perfectly correct, inasmuch as Mr. Allen had neither paid duties nor
                    did he hold a license;
